---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Story &amp; Heritage | Shree Chowdeshwari Travels"
  description="Discover the 15-year legacy of Shree Chowdeshwari Tours & Travels. Personal travel architects and company-owned luxury fleet in Bangalore, India."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-36 pb-20 bg-[#FAF8F5] border-b border-[#E8E2D6] text-left">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-bold text-[#8C733E] block mb-3">
        The Company &bull; Est. 2011
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif font-light text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-[#171717] tracking-tight leading-[1.05] mb-6">
        Crafting Timeless<br /><span class="font-editorial italic">Journeys in India</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#6B7280] max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed">
        Founded on a simple philosophy: that true hospitality requires uncompromised ownership, heartfelt care, and unwavering attention to detail.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Narrative Section -->
  <section class="py-20 sm:py-32 bg-[#FAF8F5]">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center mb-24">
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold text-[#8C733E] block">
            The Founding Vision
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif font-light text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#171717]">
            "Your Journey. Our Priority."
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-[#6B7280] font-light leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              In 2011, Shree Chowdeshwari Tours &amp; Travels began with a handful of meticulously maintained vehicles and a vision to redefine outstation travel across Karnataka and South India.
            </p>
            <p>
              Today, our fleet encompasses over 100+ company-owned luxury vehicles — from executive Toyota Innova Crystas to luxury air-suspended coaches. We have welcomed more than 50,000 guests, orchestrating peaceful pilgrimages, family holidays, and corporate summits.
            </p>
            <p>
              We remain proudly independent. When you travel with us, your chauffeur is a trained, full-time colleague; your vehicle is maintained in our private facility; and your concierge is available 24 hours a day.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-[#171717] shadow-editorial">
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590050752117-238cb0fb12b1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85"
              alt="Mysore Heritage"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Pillars -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 pt-12 border-t border-[#E8E2D6]">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <span class="font-serif font-light text-3xl text-[#B89B5E] block">01</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#171717] font-normal">Punctuality &amp; Precision</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] font-light leading-relaxed">
            Your chauffeur arrives 15 minutes before departure. Flight delays and route conditions are tracked in real-time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <span class="font-serif font-light text-3xl text-[#B89B5E] block">02</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#171717] font-normal">Transparent Terms</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] font-light leading-relaxed">
            Interstate taxes, highway tolls, parking fees, and driver night allowances are itemized upfront with zero surprises.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <span class="font-serif font-light text-3xl text-[#B89B5E] block">03</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-[#171717] font-normal">Guest Sanctuary</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] font-light leading-relaxed">
            Vehicles are sanitized before every journey, equipped with emergency first aid, GPS telemetry, and 24/7 concierge backup.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
